{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47032","headline":"吊汨罗 · 齐己","name":"吊汨罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落日倚阑干，徘徊汨罗曲。\n冤魂如可吊，烟浪声似哭。\n我欲考鼋鼍之心，烹鱼龙之腹。\n尔既啖大夫之血，食大夫之肉。\n千载之後，犹斯暗伏。\n将谓唐尧之尊，还如荒悴之君。\n更有逐臣，於焉葬魂。\n得以纵其噬，[恣]其吞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47032.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47032","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}